OL,3,GNEWSABreak-ins piling pressure on
OL,4,Afirms, pub boss warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spate of burglaries has put further
OL,7,Fpressure on businesses already
OL,8,Fstruggling amid a cost-of-living
OL,9,Fcrisis, a pub chief has warned.
OL,11,FThe Station East bar in Gateshead's
OL,12,FRailways Quarter was targeted for the
OL,13,Fsecond time in six months earlier this
OL,14,Fweek, with boss Shona Burrows saying
OL,15,F"mindless damage" had forced a
OL,16,Ftemporary closure while a clean-up
OL,17,Foperation was completed.
OL,19,FShe said several other firms in the
OL,20,Farea had also been broken into recently
OL,21,Fwhich was hitting town centre
OL,22,Fregeneration efforts.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
